---
// PesquisaIc.astro - Sub-view 2: Guia de Iniciação Científica e Regras de 90h AAC
---

<div class="space-y-6 text-[#0A0A0A]">
  <div class="cagp-tool-box p-5 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_#0A0A0A] space-y-4">
    <div class="border-b-2 border-[#0A0A0A] pb-3 flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="bi bi-search text-[#8B1E2D] text-xl" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <h3 class="font-head text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase text-[#0A0A0A] m-0 tracking-wide">
            Guia de Iniciação Científica (Até 90h AAC)
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 mt-0.5 m-0 font-body font-medium">
          Como converter pesquisa acadêmica em créditos para a integralização do seu curso:
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="cagp-badge cagp-badge-green font-mono font-bold">
        Modalidade V · Art. 15
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-body">
      <div class="cagp-card p-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-2.5">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#8B1E2D] text-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <i class="bi bi-cash-coin text-base" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="font-head font-black uppercase text-xs text-[#8B1E2D] tracking-wide">
              Bolsistas Remunerados (PIBIC / FAPEMIG)
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-medium m-0">
            A Pró-Reitoria de Pesquisa (PRPq) publica editais anuais entre <strong>maio e julho</strong>. O estudante recebe bolsa mensal do CNPq, FAPEMIG ou da própria UFMG com dedicação de 20 horas semanais.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cagp-card p-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-2.5">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-[#0A0A0A] text-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <i class="bi bi-person-heart text-base text-white" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </div>
            <span class="font-head font-black uppercase text-xs text-[#0A0A0A] tracking-wide">
              Pesquisadores Voluntários
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-medium m-0">
            Vagas abertas diretamente pelos professores coordenadores dos 11 núcleos no início de cada semestre. Conta exatamente com a mesma pontuação de créditos que a bolsa remunerada.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cagp-card p-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#0A0A0A] rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1.5 shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_#0A0A0A]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
        <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-check text-[#15803D] text-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span class="font-head font-bold uppercase text-xs text-[#0A0A0A] tracking-wide">
          Documentação para Integralização das Horas
        </span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-body font-medium m-0">
        Ao final do plano de trabalho, solicite a declaração de conclusão emitida pelo orientador ou certificado da PRPq e protocole via <strong>Requerimento N-20229</strong> na Secretaria Sala F-2039.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
      <a href="/acg#calculadora" class="cagp-btn-primary text-xs py-2 px-3.5 no-underline inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-head font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <i class="bi bi-calculator" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>Simular 90h na Calculadora &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.ufmg.br/prpq/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cagp-btn-secondary text-xs py-2 px-3.5 no-underline inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-head font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>Portal PRPq UFMG &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>